  "properties": {
    "title": "PICANTEO: a multi-modal open source change detection pipeline for reliable uncertainty-aware disaster response",
    "description": "This presentation will introduce PICANTEO, a new open-source change detection tool developed at the French space agency (CNES).\r\nThis tool was designed to support the International Charter \u201cSpace and Major Disasters\u201d by providing maps that locate and assess damage in the aftermath of a disaster.\r\nThe presentation will give an overview of the entire framework, highlight its features, and explain its key functionalities.",
